    "title": "The big daughter of Leonid Agutin was married",
    "text": "An important event that happened in the family of Russian artist Leonid Agutin: the eldest daughter of artist Polina Vorobyova, tied herself with a binding to a foreign man, a French named Zhuan. The grandfather of the famous girl, the composer Nikolai Agutin, confirmed the reality of Polina's marriage, currently living in the UK. He dreamed of great children as soon as possible.\nI think, now the boys have their own apartments, when they will spend more time in loneliness, perhaps the heirs will appear faster with us. My son has completed well, it creates conditions for everyone, so that his children can try to live a person.\nStories about Agutin Elizabeth, a successful music artist, who chose life in the United States, developed in parallel. Actively traveling and speaking at concert locations, the girl has achieved significant professional success and management to get her own housing.\nLisa has earned her apartment, she lived in her. I bought it myself! Imagine! Share Petrovich.",
